{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51924","headline":"国学新修五经壁歌（幷记） · 无名氏","name":"国学新修五经壁歌（幷记）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我有学宇，既倾而成之。\n我有壁经，既昧而明之。\n孰规摹之？孰发挥之？祭酒维齐，博士维韦。\n俾我学徒，弦歌以时。\n切切祁祁，不敖不嬉。\n庶乎遒人，来采我诗。\n（《刘梦得集》二六《记》）（〖1〗此歌原收刘禹锡名下，然按记中所述，应爲国学生徒所作，故移归无名氏。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51924.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51924","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}